==English==

=== Etymology ===
From Greek νεφρός - ''[[nephrology|nephros]]'', meaning "of the kidney", and [[-itis]], a suffix  meaning "inflammation".

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}
# Of or relating to the [[kidney]]s.
# Of, relating to, or affected with [[nephritis]]. 

